    "effect": "This book tells you which mushrooms are good to eat and which ones will give you a bad trip.\n\nRank 1 - Novice Survival: You automatically identify all @UUID[Compendium.ptu.items.Item.w5F8OjCc7rGRSlXz]{Tiny Mushrooms}, @UUID[Compendium.ptu.items.Item.qjXGxkVxalQcIpuD]{Big Mushrooms}, and @UUID[Compendium.ptu.items.Item.zwuNF6cJs843IqJj]{Balm Mushrooms} you pick. Whenever you or your Pokémon consume one of those Mushrooms, they ignore the negative effect of the Mushroom (Hit Point loss, Poison, Combat Stage loss).\nRank 2 - Adept Survival: You can create the @UUID[Compendium.ptu.references.Item.Qtp2UOCWXPfNN5MX]{Hearty Meal} Chef Recipe as an Extended Action but only by using Mushrooms as ingredients.",
